cience, and Engineering of Fuzzing: A Survey"}]},{"type":"text","value":", received an early holiday present!"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"blockquote","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Congratulations!"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"On behalf of Vice President for Publications, David Ebert, I am writing to inform you that your paper, \"The Art, Science, and Engineering of Fuzzing: A Survey,\" has been awarded the 2021 Best Paper Award from IEEE Transactions on Software Engineering by the IEEE Computer Society Publications Board."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"This was quite unexpected, as our article was accepted back in 2019 -- four years ago!  But it only \"appeared\" in the November 2021 editions of the journal."}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"You can access this article "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/8863940"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"here"}]},{"type":"text","value":" or, as always, on my "},{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"/publications"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"publications page"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"data":{"quirksMode":false}},"timeToRead":1,"fields":{"slug":"/blog/2023-01-16--ieee-transactions-on-software-engineering-2021-best-paper-award/"},"frontmatter":{"tags":["papers","publications","fuzzing"],"title":"\"The Art, Science, and Engineering of Fuzzing: A Survey\" receives IEEE Transactions on Software Engineering 2021 Best Paper Award","updatedDate":"16 January, 2023","image":null,"author":{"jsonId":"Edward J. Schwart